to her--Stone to Flesh.  It had been a while since she'd seen a spell
she didn't know, so she wanted to use it somehow.  Now she had no use
for it practically, but she cast it on everything of stone and
collected a great many meatballs.  Every tiime she did another round
of polypiling (when the stuff burdened her or when her player got
bored of killing monsters) she included the meatballs in her piling. 
Her goal was to get as many of some polypiled food source as possible.
 Her record is 231 carrots, but last time she got 145 eggs.  I was
pretty pleased with that and chalked it down to the hoard of fire
giants she had recently met.  I thought nothing of it until I suddenly
saw about a quarter of the space that had been mine town before I
